{"id":"CVE-2024-3737","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"VulDB","published":"2024-04-13T16:31:05.372Z","updated":"2024-08-01T20:20:01.222Z","title":"cym1102 nginxWebUI addOver findCountByQuery path traversal","description":"A vulnerability was found in cym1102 nginxWebUI up to 3.9.9. It has been rated as critical. Affected by this issue is the function findCountByQuery of the file /adminPage/www/addOver. The manipulation of the argument dir leads to path traversal. The attack may be launched remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The identifier of this vulnerability is VDB-260576.","cwe":["CWE-22 CWE-22 Path Traversal"],"metrics":[{"src":"cna","v":"3.1","score":6.3,"sev":"MEDIUM","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:L"},{"src":"cna","v":"3.0","score":6.3,"sev":"MEDIUM","vector":"CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:L"},{"src":"cna","v":"2.0","score":6.5,"sev":null,"vector":"AV:N/AC:L/Au:S/C:P/I:P/A:P"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"none","Automatable":"no","Technical Impact":"partial"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"cym1102","product":"nginxWebUI","versions":["affected 3.9.0","affected 3.9.1","affected 3.9.2","affected 3.9.3","affected 3.9.4","affected 3.9.5","affected 3.9.6","affected 3.9.7","affected 3.9.8","affected 3.9.9"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://vuldb.com/?id.260576","tags":["vdb-entry","technical-description"],"name":"VDB-260576 | cym1102 nginxWebUI addOver findCountByQuery path traversal"},{"url":"https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.260576","tags":["signature","permissions-required"],"name":"VDB-260576 | CTI Indicators (IOB, IOC, TTP, IOA)"},{"url":"https://github.com/cym1102/nginxWebUI/issues/138","tags":["issue-tracking"]},{"url":"https://github.com/cym1102/nginxWebUI/files/14818455/nginxwebui.rce.3.9.9.pdf","tags":["exploit"]}],"vendors":["nginx"]}
{"id":"CVE-2024-3738","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"VulDB","published":"2024-04-13T17:31:04.866Z","updated":"2024-09-03T17:59:26.886Z","title":"cym1102 nginxWebUI saveCmd handlePath certificate validation","description":"A vulnerability classified as critical has been found in cym1102 nginxWebUI up to 3.9.9. This affects the function handlePath of the file /adminPage/conf/saveCmd. The manipulation of the argument nginxPath leads to improper certificate validation. It is possible to initiate the attack remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The identifier VDB-260577 was assigned to this vulnerability.","cwe":["CWE-295 CWE-295 Improper Certificate Validation"],"metrics":[{"src":"cna","v":"3.1","score":7.3,"sev":"HIGH","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:L"},{"src":"cna","v":"3.0","score":7.3,"sev":"HIGH","vector":"CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:L"},{"src":"cna","v":"2.0","score":7.5,"sev":null,"vector":"AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"poc","Automatable":"yes","Technical Impact":"partial"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"cym1102","product":"nginxWebUI","versions":["affected 3.9.0","affected 3.9.1","affected 3.9.2","affected 3.9.3","affected 3.9.4","affected 3.9.5","affected 3.9.6","affected 3.9.7","affected 3.9.8","affected 3.9.9"]},{"vendor":"nginxui","product":"nginx_ui","defaultStatus":"unknown","cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:nginxui:nginx_ui:*:*:*:*:*:*:*:*"],"versions":["affected 3.9.0","affected 3.9.1","affected 3.9.2","affected 3.9.3","affected 3.9.4","affected 3.9.5","affected 3.9.6","affected 3.9.7","affected 3.9.8","affected 3.9.9"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://vuldb.com/?id.260577","tags":["vdb-entry","technical-description"],"name":"VDB-260577 | cym1102 nginxWebUI saveCmd handlePath certificate validation"},{"url":"https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.260577","tags":["signature","permissions-required"],"name":"VDB-260577 | CTI Indicators (IOB, IOC, TTP, IOA)"},{"url":"https://github.