{"id":"CVE-2024-49366","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"GitHub_M","published":"2024-10-21T16:12:00.495Z","updated":"2024-10-21T16:42:19.269Z","title":"Nginx UI's json field can construct a directory traversal payload, causing arbitrary files to be written","description":"Nginx UI is a web user interface for the Nginx web server. Nginx UI v2.0.0-beta.35 and earlier gets the value from the json field without verification, and can construct a value value in the form of `../../`. Arbitrary files can be written to the server, which may result in loss of permissions. Version 2.0.0-beta.26 fixes the issue.","cwe":["CWE-22 CWE-22: Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory ('Path Traversal')"],"metrics":[{"src":"cna","v":"4.0","score":7.7,"sev":"HIGH","vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:P"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"poc","Automatable":"yes","Technical Impact":"partial"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"0xJacky","product":"nginx-ui","versions":["affected < 2.0.0-beta.36"]},{"vendor":"nginxui","product":"nginx_ui","defaultStatus":"unknown","cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:nginxui:nginx_ui:*:*:*:*:*:*:*:*"],"versions":["affected 0 <2.0.0-beta.36 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://github.com/0xJacky/nginx-ui/security/advisories/GHSA-prv4-rx44-f7jr","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://github.com/0xJacky/nginx-ui/releases/tag/v2.0.0-beta.36","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]}],"vendors":["nginx"]}
{"id":"CVE-2024-49367","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"GitHub_M","published":"2024-10-21T16:24:56.701Z","updated":"2024-10-21T16:42:33.926Z","title":"Nginx UI's log path can be controlled","description":"Nginx UI is a web user interface for the Nginx web server. Prior to version 2.0.0-beta.36, the log path of nginxui is controllable. This issue can be combined with the directory traversal at `/api/configs` to read directories and file contents on the server. Version 2.0.0-beta.36 fixes the issue.","cwe":["CWE-862 CWE-862: Missing Authorization"],"metrics":[{"src":"cna","v":"4.0","score":5.5,"sev":"MEDIUM","vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:P"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"poc","Automatable":"yes","Technical Impact":"partial"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"0xJacky","product":"nginx-ui","versions":["affected < 2.0.0-beta.36"]},{"vendor":"nginxui","product":"nginx_ui","defaultStatus":"unknown","cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:nginxui:nginx_ui:*:*:*:*:*:*:*:*"],"versions":["affected 0 <2.0.0-beta.36 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://github.com/0xJacky/nginx-ui/security/advisories/GHSA-gr34-jgw4-7j4m","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://github.com/0xJacky/nginx-ui/releases/tag/v2.0.0-beta.36","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]}],"vendors":["nginx"]}
{"id":"CVE-2024-49368","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"GitHub_M","published":"2024-10-21T17:04:43.652Z","updated":"2026-11-04T00:06:07.715Z","title":"Unchecked logrotate settings lead to arbitrary command execution","description":"Nginx UI is a web user interface for the Nginx web server. Prior to version 2.0.0-beta.36, when Nginx UI configures logrotate, it does not verify the input and directly passes it to exec.Command, causing arbitrary command execution. Version 2.0.0-beta.36 fixes this issue.","cwe":["CWE-20 CWE-20: Improper Input Validation"],"metrics":[{"src":"cna","v":"4.0","score":8.9,"sev":"HIGH","vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:P"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"none","Automatable":"yes","Technical Impact":"total"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"0xJacky","product":"nginx-ui","versions":["affected < 2.0.0-beta.36"]},{"vendor":"nginxui","product":"nginx_ui","defaultStatus":"unknown","cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:nginxui:nginx_ui:*:*:*:*:*:*:*:*"],"versions":["affected 0 <2.0.0-beta.36 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://github.com/0xJacky/nginx-ui/security/advisories/GHSA-66m6-27r9-77vm","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://github.com/0xJacky/nginx-ui/releases/tag/v2.0.0-beta.36","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]}],"vendors":["nginx"]}
